# Final Project Overview

#### Let's take a moment to *begin with the end in mind* by taking a look at the Final Project for this Unit.

## Multi-Page Web Application

#### In this project, students take on the role of web designers to create a multi-page digital magazine for a fictional user or community.

<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; background: #f7f8fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto;">

  <div>
    <h4 style="margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold">Students willl:</h4>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 10px; font-size: 14pt">
      <li>Identify their target audience and brand.
</li> <br>
    <li>Plan the layout for key pages like a home page and article page.
</li><br>
        <li>Use AI in Guide mode to help them generate the HTML and CSS needed to build their site. 
        </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <img src="https://images.code.org/4e1b6412c687590c048f087cef0675e6-image-1741789708762.png" 
